        "description": "Join 30,000 players enjoying our fun fitness games – all with top-rated reviews!\n\nWhat the review pros are saying:\n- Otterwordly: \"I highly highly recommend Action Resort\"\n- KaleahVR: \"probably my favorite fitness game so far\"\n- VivaHawaii: \"The Most Fun Way To Get Fit On the Meta Quest 3\"\n- WelshGamer: \"this is a really cool mode good\"\n\n{1077864257371288}\n\nAction Resort is a collection of games designed for all intensity levels – from low-key to high-energy fun:\n\n• Boxing Practice: One of the most intense modes, featuring the most realistic and customizable trainer you'll find in the Store.\n\n{899336105513784}\n\n• Smoothie Bar: Take it easy and relax while crafting delicious virtual smoothies – the ultimate chill-out mode.\n\n{439657902524108}\n\n• Ball Smasher Mode: A challenging workout that trains not just your body but also your reflexes and brain. Are you ready?\n\n• Mascot Punching Bags: Need to blow off some steam? Go wild with our hilarious, fun-loving mascots as your personal punching bags!\n\n{8640016099459443}\n\nAll of this with no subscription fees, just a low one-time price. Judging by the reviews, it’s pretty unlikely you won’t love it!\n\nTry it now!",
